Package: ss3diags2
Type: Package
Title: Stock Synthesis Diagnostics and Data Extraction in 'FLR'
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Henning", "Winker", email = "henning.winker@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: The next generation of 'ss3diags'. Extracts observations and model
    outputs from Stock Synthesis (SS3) reports, as read by 'r4ss::SS_output()',
    into long 'data.table' tables (len/age, year, unit, season, area, iter, data)
    that convert directly to 'FLR' classes: catch by fleet as 'FLQuants',
    abundance indices as 'FLIndices' of 'FLIndexBiomass', and length and age
    compositions by fleet as 'FLQuants' (sex as unit, season as season).
    Inputs are shaped to match 'JABBA3' and 'FLicc', so an SS3 model can be
    refitted with simpler models directly. Diagnostics (runs tests, joint
    residuals, retrospectives, hindcast cross-validation, MVLN) follow in
    'ggplot2', harmonised with 'JABBA3' and 'FLicc'.
